---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Now — Max Sapo">
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Now"
    title="What I am focused on now."
    lede="A lightweight status page. Updated when reality changes, which is rude but frequent."
  />
  <section class="container prose">
    <p><strong>Updated:</strong> August 2026</p>
    <h2>Work</h2>
    <p>
      Focused on AI infrastructure and TPU performance: how compute, latency, efficiency, and developer experience translate into product capability.
    </p>
    <h2>Writing</h2>
    <p>
      Drafting notes on AI interfaces, product leadership in infrastructure-heavy domains, and the emotional/behavioral side of working with intelligent systems.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions I am sitting with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>What is the right interface for persistent AI collaborators?</li>
      <li>How do AI infrastructure constraints shape product strategy?</li>
      <li>What does excellent product taste look like when models are the medium?</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
